{"code":"352940","name":"인바이오","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"화학","sector_desc":"석유화학·정밀화학·2차전지 소재 등. 유가, 중국 수요, 스프레드(제품가−원료가)가 실적을 좌우합니다.","desc":"동사는 1997년 농약 제조 및 판매업을 목적으로 설립되었으며, 2020년 코스닥시장에 상장하였음. 황 성분을 가진 친환경 작물보호제인 석회황합제, 광범위 살충제인 인도에마 등 살균제, 살충제, 제초제 및 비료의 제조와 판매를 주요 사업으로 영위하고 있음. 농협경제지주 및 단위농협을 통한 판매와 국내 10개 지점에서 지역별 도소매상을 통한 유통망을 구축하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-28","n_days":300,"close":1938.0,"open":1875.0,"high":2115.0,"low":1875.0,"volume":5189,"amount":10056282.0,"ret_1d":1.8927,"gap":-1.4196,"range_pct":12.3839,"ret_5":-0.6154,"ret_20":-7.494,"ret_60":-3.1,"ret_120":-14.4371,"ret_250":-10.0696,"ma20":2020.05,"ma60":2042.35,"ma120":2070.9333,"ma200":2102.22,"close_vs_ma200":-7.8117,"close_vs_ma60":-5.1093,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":3.988,"r2_60":0.005,"slope_120":-14.9558,"r2_120":0.2099,"slope_250":-10.1703,"r2_250":0.3315,"high52":2450.0,"low52":1815.0,"pos_52w":19.3701,"dd_52w":-20.898,"mdd_1y":-21.0788,"atr14_pct":11.2708,"vol_ann_60":46.7161,"vol_avg20":7930.3,"vol_ratio20":0.6543,"vr5":0.2811,"vr20":0.3422,"amount_avg5":11421196.8,"amount_avg20":15995237.0,"amount_avg60":43468237.8833,"obv_chg20":-41.5621,"turnover_20":1.4594,"pv_eff_20":-5.1349,"rsi14":43.9116,"frgn_net_5":-3469.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0319,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0319,"frgn_net_20":-13479.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.124,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.124,"frgn_net_60":42155.0,"inst_net_60":8000.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.3879,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0736,"smart_net_60_pct":0.4615,"frgn_net_120":29114.0,"inst_net_120":8000.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.2679,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0736,"smart_net_120_pct":0.3415,"foreign_ratio":1.57,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.39,"smart_buy_streak":2,"op_income_q":2.0,"op_margin_q":1.9231,"op_qoq":-93.5484,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":200.0,"rev_yoy":22.3529,"op_trend_4q":62.6415,"fin_period":"202606","roe":1.3,"debt_ratio":77.17,"per":36.57,"pbr":0.47,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":1.57